1
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:48,200
Jiaojiao,

2
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,959
what are you doing this time?

3
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,959
Martial arts tournament for marriage.

4
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:57,040
You've been telling people I love street fights.

5
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,599
I might as well set up a ring

6
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,599
and find a strong guy.

7
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,760
If you're so eager to get married,

8
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,200
you'll surely find a good husband.

9
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,480
It seems you're even more anxious than me.

10
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:07,560
Watch and see.

11
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,840
Hmph!

12
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:34,919
[Steamed buns!]

13
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:37,080
[Freshly made steamed buns!]

14
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,240
That's strange.

15
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,039
Not a single soul around.

16
00:03:58,599 --> 00:04:00,080
Su's Escort Agency.

17
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,639
The escort lives with the escort.

18
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:05,240
Oh.

19
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,000
Forget it, Jiaojiao.

20
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,599
No one will come.

21
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:21,959
Sir,

22
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,560
if you want to stay in the inn,

23
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,040
you have to wait until tomorrow morning.

24
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,399
If you want to drink,

25
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,480
you have to wait until noon.

26
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,879
Who said we were here to stay at an inn?

27
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,120
My young master is here to attend the Nebula Assembly.

28
00:05:31,319 --> 00:05:32,439
Nebula Assembly?

29
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:36,160
Please leave your previous works and names.

30
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:38,040
If they are approved by my young lady,

31
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,040
you will be qualified to participate in the Nebula Assembly.

32
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,040
Come to Huayue Tower on the 15th

33
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:43,199
for the preliminary contest.

34
00:05:43,759 --> 00:05:45,079
We are from other places.

35
00:05:45,639 --> 00:05:47,480
If we come but can't participate,

36
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,800
wouldn't it be a wasted trip?

37
00:05:54,759 --> 00:05:55,879
Yunjing residents.

38
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,800
Yunjing residents.

39
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,560
If you're talented,

40
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:03,360
it won't be a wasted trip.

41
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,279
I thought

42
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:10,439
the Nebula Assembly was for talented people from all over the world.

43
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,959
I didn't expect it to be...

44
00:06:19,399 --> 00:06:20,240
Okay.

45
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,199
Thank you.

46
00:06:21,439 --> 00:06:24,040
Please support me at the Nebula Assembly.

47
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,600
Impossible.

48
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:42,480
I've already changed it.

49
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,199
Please.

50
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:10,160
You took five hits.

51
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,519
You win.

52
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,319
Really?

53
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,600
When do I start?

54
00:07:15,399 --> 00:07:16,199
Start working?

55
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,839
Aren't you here for the marriage selection?

56
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:20,920
Aren't you hiring for odd jobs?

57
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,639
Then why are you fighting me?

58
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:41,879
You started it!

59
00:07:43,839 --> 00:07:44,839
Gong Xi, Fa Cai,

60
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,040
let's go.

61
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,920
Let's get to work now.

62
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,360
I'll go home and pack up.

63
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,800
He's good at martial arts.

64
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,079
We can hire him

65
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:16,920
can be considered.

66
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,639
Although I don't know Kungfu,

67
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:26,959
but

68
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,319
I'll be the head of the Escort Agency.

69
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:32,679
And I'll be in charge of the money.

70
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:42,080
Ah.

71
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:43,480
Gong Xi

72
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,679
Write it outside.

73
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,399
Make a living, support the wife and educate the children.

74
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,159
Uncle

75
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,279
Your son should do it himself.

76
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:59,080
I can do it myself.

77
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,799
I'm in good health.

78
00:09:04,399 --> 00:09:05,559
I just want to know

79
00:09:05,559 --> 00:09:07,919
how much money you can give me.

80
00:09:07,919 --> 00:09:08,799
My friend,

81
00:09:09,879 --> 00:09:12,639
if you marry into our Su family,

82
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,080
you can

83
00:09:23,919 --> 00:09:25,360
call me grandfather.

84
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:26,799
I'm in good health.

85
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,919
Ha ha ha.

86
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:52,480
Hahaha.

87
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:58,720
Please teach me.

88
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,600
The legendary one-leg stand.

89
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:52,519
Su Yuejiao,

90
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:53,919
enough is enough.

91
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,000
No one would set rules like yours.

92
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,039
Are my rules too much?

93
00:10:58,039 --> 00:10:58,919
This is a marriage selection,

94
00:10:58,919 --> 00:10:59,960
not recruiting escort.

95
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:02,320
Oh,

96
00:11:02,559 --> 00:11:03,799
listen to me,

97
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,799
You'd better find a man to marry.

98
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:07,200
Why do you have to recruit a son-in-law?

99
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,360
Why do you have to ask?

100
00:11:08,399 --> 00:11:10,639
Whether I get married or not, I won't leave the Escort Agency.

101
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:13,360
Do you want to take over the Agency?

102
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:16,080
Dad

103
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:18,919
Ah.

104
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:21,720
You're so grown up but still don't understand.

105
00:11:21,879 --> 00:11:22,919
Ah.

106
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:25,639
You don't know to save my dad's heart.

107
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:27,519
You should do the same.

108
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:28,600
You...

109
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,799
Don't think you can be rude because you're good at martial arts.

110
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,679
I'm your senior after all.

111
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,600
You are always idling away your time.

112
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:39,120
You either run up bills at the inn or lose the escort.

113
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,279
You were even taken to the police station.

114
00:11:40,279 --> 00:11:41,120
Senior?

115
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,919
I won't let you ruin the Escort Agency anymore.

116
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,279
Su Yuejiao

117
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:49,080
You're not in charge of the escort agency now.

118
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:49,840
Leave me alone.

119
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:51,639
By the way,

120
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:54,240
pay the bill of Huayue Tower for me.

121
00:11:55,919 --> 00:11:56,679
Alas.

122
00:11:56,679 --> 00:11:57,960
Jiaojiao.

123
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,320
Brother, can you stand this?

124
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,320
I can't stand it anymore,

125
00:12:01,919 --> 00:12:02,759
but I have to.

126
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:06,120
He is spoiled by Grandma and Mother.

127
00:12:07,639 --> 00:12:08,279
No.

128
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,679
You spoiled him.

129
00:12:09,799 --> 00:12:10,519
Well.

130
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,320
Don't be angry.

131
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,360
It's more important to recruit a son-in-law.

132
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,879
Tang Xin always has a lot of ideas.

133
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:18,000
Why don't you ask her for advice?

134
00:12:18,559 --> 00:12:19,840
You have been sisters for many years.

135
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,080
Except me,

136
00:12:21,519 --> 00:12:23,000
only she and Grandpa won't hurt you.

137
00:12:23,159 --> 00:12:24,279
Why don't you listen to her?

138
00:12:25,799 --> 00:12:26,960
Da Qi is right.

139
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,960
You should have listened to me.

140
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,480
Put the notice here.

141
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:35,519
The Nebula Assembly is coming.

142
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:38,120
There will be many young talents.

143
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,399
I'll help you find a good husband.

144
00:12:39,399 --> 00:12:40,200
Okay.

145
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,320
Are you sure?

146
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,879
How many people

147
00:12:43,879 --> 00:12:45,480
in your Huayue Tower are willing to...

148
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,679
Open your mind.

149
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:50,159
This is Yunjing.

150
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,559
There is nothing impossible

151
00:12:51,559 --> 00:12:52,559
but unimaginable.

152
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:57,279
Maybe a man will fall from the sky.

153
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,000
Don't laugh at me.

154
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,960
The Su family is recruiting a son-in-law again.

155
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,519
Why don't you go and sign up?

156
00:13:04,879 --> 00:13:06,720
I'm the only son in my family.

157
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,559
How can I marry into a woman's family?

158
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,399
It sounds like you can marry into a woman's family,

159
00:13:09,399 --> 00:13:10,679
and you dare to marry her.

160
00:13:11,039 --> 00:13:11,960
Who dares to marry her?

161
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,399
Why not?

162
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,360
The girl of the Su family

163
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,840
grew up fighting in the streets.

164
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:19,440
She is fierce and hot-tempered.

165
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:23,320
If you marry her, you'll be beaten every day.

166
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,399
Yeah.

167
00:13:24,399 --> 00:13:26,000
Have you ever met her?

168
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:27,240
You just talk nonsense.

169
00:13:28,679 --> 00:13:29,799
Think about it.

170
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,799
A woman as an escort.

171
00:13:31,799 --> 00:13:33,080
and fights all day.

172
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,200
It's not decent at all.

173
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,720
Yeah.

174
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:38,480
Is there a rule that women can't be escorts?

175
00:13:38,879 --> 00:13:41,120
A wife should help her husband and educate the children.

176
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,480
She can't do that.

177
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,840
You can do that?

178
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,960
How?

179
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,440
Hey, how dare you talk like that?

180
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:49,519
Who are you?

181
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:51,879
I...

182
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:54,120
I am

183
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:55,799
Su Yuejiao.

184
00:14:01,559 --> 00:14:03,080
Sir, be careful.

185
00:14:06,279 --> 00:14:07,120
But

186
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:10,080
will posting notices here affect the escort agency's reputation?

187
00:14:11,279 --> 00:14:13,960
When my dad escorted goods with your mom,

188
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,000
he always mentioned

189
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:18,080
what is the most important thing for an escort agency.

190
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,080
The escort lives with the escort.

191
00:14:20,799 --> 00:14:21,759
As long as the escort is well delivered,

192
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:22,759
and the price is reasonable,

193
00:14:22,759 --> 00:14:24,200
no one cares how you recruit a son-in-law.

194
00:14:25,519 --> 00:14:27,639
Well, you know,

195
00:14:27,759 --> 00:14:29,039
I want to be the head of the family,

196
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,679
not because I want to compete with my uncle,

197
00:14:31,039 --> 00:14:33,000
nor because of the rules set by my grandmother.

198
00:14:33,399 --> 00:14:36,120
I just want to protect the escort agency

199
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,679
my mother has guarded for a lifetime.

200
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:39,799
If I had a sister who could run the family,

201
00:14:39,799 --> 00:14:41,639
I just wanted to be a small escort.

202
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,159
I understand.

203
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:46,120
My mother is a musician.

204
00:14:46,120 --> 00:14:47,360
I also like music theory.

205
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,600
So I became a musician.

206
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:51,639
It's a pity that your three brothers are not hard-working.

207
00:14:51,639 --> 00:14:52,639
You have to take the responsibility.

208
00:14:56,279 --> 00:14:59,000
But have you thought it over?

209
00:14:59,039 --> 00:15:02,600
Are you willing to marry someone for the escort agency?

210
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:07,519
What can I do?

211
00:15:07,879 --> 00:15:09,279
I can only become the Seal Keeper after getting married.

212
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:11,200
No one told me about this rule before.

213
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,000
When I'm almost an adult,

214
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,240
Su Lishi suddenly jumped out and interfered.

215
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,159
But for me,

216
00:15:17,399 --> 00:15:18,360
it doesn't matter who I marry.

217
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:20,720
I just want to stay in the Escort Agency.

218
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:24,919
It's good not to suffer from love.

219
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,159
Unlike me,

220
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,159
I like a block of wood.

221
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,360
I'll be killed by anger or suffocation.

222
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:32,639
Who dares to make you angry?

223
00:15:32,639 --> 00:15:33,279
I'll beat him up.

224
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,879
Jiaojiao

225
00:15:35,279 --> 00:15:36,639
You are the best.

226
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:38,639
I have another idea.

227
00:15:38,919 --> 00:15:39,720
What idea?

228
00:15:40,279 --> 00:15:41,320
Matchmaker Pavilion

229
00:15:57,159 --> 00:15:57,960
Wow.

230
00:16:08,919 --> 00:16:10,279
Miss, what brings you here?

231
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:13,919
I haven't seen that man before.

232
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,399
He's an outsider

233
00:16:15,399 --> 00:16:16,200
for the Star Conference.

234
00:16:16,799 --> 00:16:18,200
Show me his paper.

235
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:18,559
Okay.

236
00:16:27,759 --> 00:16:29,080
He's got some talent,

237
00:16:29,759 --> 00:16:31,919
but his writing's all form, no soul.

238
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,919
Put him at the bottom of the list.

239
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:35,360
Got it.

240
00:16:37,399 --> 00:16:39,120
Is the newly opened Matchmaker Pavilion

241
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,960
that good?

242
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:46,120
Our Shopkeeper Li

243
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:49,039
was widowed for years.

244
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,240
But recently,

245
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:52,440
the Matchmaker Pavilion found him a wife.

246
00:16:52,519 --> 00:16:54,240
They got married in a month.

247
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,720
Mr. Li got married?

248
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,000
Then why do I need to post the notice?

249
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,519
Tell me how to get to the Matchmaker Pavilion.

250
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:21,960
Young Master,

251
00:17:22,559 --> 00:17:23,480
we risked

252
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,000
punishment from the master to come here.

253
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,279
This Nebula Assembly is so unfair.

254
00:17:27,759 --> 00:17:28,799
How can we come out

255
00:17:28,799 --> 00:17:30,240
in half a month?

256
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,960
As long as we have a reason.

257
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:34,640
Wake up, Young Master.

258
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,720
You neither take the exam nor study in the academy.

259
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,119
This time,

260
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:40,240
the master will never let you out.

261
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:42,680
There is only one way to make him agree.

262
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,839
Su Yuejiao's advertisement

263
00:17:57,839 --> 00:18:00,039
is even posted in the Huayue Tower.

264
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:01,319
A hefty reward for a son-in-law.

265
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,559
Su's Escort Agency is good.

266
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,519
Why don't you have a try?

267
00:18:03,599 --> 00:18:05,039
There are indeed a lot of people.

268
00:18:05,759 --> 00:18:07,799
I don't know if it will work this time.

269
00:18:07,799 --> 00:18:08,680
I have to leave a successor for my family.

270
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,799
But I can't be a live-in son-in-law.

271
00:18:09,839 --> 00:18:11,400
The rice is too soft for me.

272
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,720
It's quite suitable for you.

273
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,160
It's suitable for you.

274
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:15,359
It's suitable for you.

275
00:18:23,119 --> 00:18:24,839
Chief Escort Su, what a coincidence.

276
00:18:25,119 --> 00:18:26,000
The food is soft.

277
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,640
I think you've lost your teeth.

278
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,480
I think you've lost your legs.

279
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,079
You have such a bad temper.

280
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,759
Do you still want to be the head of the family?

281
00:18:44,839 --> 00:18:46,079
I really can't deal with you.

282
00:18:46,359 --> 00:18:48,720
